==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 5.33~16 seconds<sup>160f~480f</sup>.
*6 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 10~16 seconds<sup>300f~480f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

